.\" webapp v0.0.0 2026-09-29
.SH CONFIGURATION
.SS General
.TP
.B APP_NAME
Human\-readable application name. Default: webapp.
.TP
.B APP_DEBUG
Enable debug logging; hot\-reloadable via APP_DEBUG. Default: false. Hot\-reloadable.
.TP
.B APP_JSON_OUTPUT
Print machine\-readable JSON output.
.TP
.B APP_OUTPUT_FORMAT
Output format. Default: text. One of: text, json.
.TP
.B APP_TEXT_OUTPUT
Print human\-readable text output.
.SS Server
.TP
.B APP_PORT
HTTP port the server listens on. Default: 8080. Range: 1024\-65535.
.TP
.B APP_TLS_CERT
Path to the TLS certificate (required when tls\-enabled=true). \fBREQUIRED.\fR
.TP
.B APP_TLS_ENABLED
Enable TLS. Default: false.
.SS Database
.TP
.B DB_HOST
Database host. Default: localhost.
.TP
.B DB_NAME
Database name. \fBREQUIRED.\fR
.TP
.B DB_PASSWORD
Database password. \fBREQUIRED. SENSITIVE.\fR
.TP
.B DB_PORT
Database port. Default: 5432. Range: 1\-65535.
.TP
.B DB_USER
Database user. Default: postgres.
.SS Email
.TP
.B EMAIL_ENABLED
Send notification emails. Default: false.
.TP
.B SMTP_HOST
SMTP server host. Default: localhost.
.TP
.B SMTP_PASSWORD
SMTP password. \fBREQUIRED. SENSITIVE.\fR
.TP
.B SMTP_PORT
SMTP server port. Default: 587. Range: 1\-65535.
.TP
.B SMTP_USER
SMTP user. \fBREQUIRED.\fR
.SS Deprecated
.TP
.B APP_LOG_FILE
File to write logs to.
.B "DEPRECATED: logs go to stderr; redirect them instead"
